# 6. Categories Section

Create a "Shop By Category" section.

Categories could include:

* Fashion
* Electronics
* Beauty
* Home & Living
* Accessories
* Sports
* Footwear
* Gadgets

Each category should have:

* Image
* Category name
* Product count
* Hover animation

Use Bootstrap responsive grid.

Example:

```text
SHOP BY CATEGORY

[ Fashion ] [ Electronics ] [ Beauty ] [ Home ]

[ Sports ]  [ Footwear ]   [ Gadgets ] [ Accessories ]
```

