# 22. Responsive Design

The entire application MUST work perfectly on:

### Mobile

```text
320px
375px
390px
414px
```

### Tablet

```text
768px
820px
1024px
```

### Desktop

```text
1280px
1440px
1920px
```

Use Bootstrap breakpoints and responsive CSS.

Avoid horizontal scrolling.

